It rings a couple of times.
The screen lights up.
I see a living room.
There is sun, and the living room is very bright.
I see two people.
It is my mother and my father.
They smile a lot and wave to me.
"Hello mom and dad!" I say loudly.
"Hello, Maya," my father says.
"How is it going?"
"It is going well," I answer happily.
Suddenly I hear a sound.
It is a little bark.
"Oh, I hear a dog!" I say and laugh.
A little dog jumps up onto a sofa.
It looks into the camera.
"There is my dog!"
"Hello, Lola," I say.
Lola wags her tail.
"Yes, it is your dog," my mother says with a smile.
I love my family.
It is lovely to see them all.
